                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">2</span>
                    
                    
                    
                  <span id="footnote2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">GPT</span> uses sliding window attention <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib6" title="" class="ltx_ref">Beltagy et al. (2020)</a></cite> so that cache size per token varies over the time.</span></span></span></td></tr>
